---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import ContentPage from '../layouts/ContentPage.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import { pharmacyTeam } from '../data/team';
import jason from '../assets/images/jason-pharmacist-portrait.jpg';
import dispensary from '../assets/images/jason-dispensary-counter.jpg';

const path = '/about-us/';
const breadcrumbs = [{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'About us', href: path }];
const faqs = [
  { q: 'Is Priceline Pharmacy Pacific Fair locally owned?', a: 'Yes. We’re an independently owned Priceline Pharmacy franchise store, owned and run by pharmacist Jason Markey, who lives and works on the Gold Coast.' },
  { q: 'How long has the store been at Pacific Fair?', a: 'The store opened in August 2009 and has been on the ground floor of Pacific Fair ever since. Our store manager, Ben, has been here from the start.' },
  { q: 'Is there a doctor in the store?', a: 'Yes. <a href="/help-medical/">Help Medical</a>, an independent general practice, is located inside our store, with QML Pathology collection on weekday mornings.' },
  { q: 'Can I just walk in and ask a pharmacist a question?', a: 'Of course. No appointment is needed to speak with a pharmacist. If we’re busy there may be a short wait, but we’ll make time for you.' },
];
---

<ContentPage
  title="About Our Locally Owned Pharmacy | Priceline Pacific Fair"
  description="Meet the team at Priceline Pharmacy Pacific Fair, a locally owned Broadbeach pharmacy known for genuine care, expert advice and great service."
  path={path}
  h1="About Priceline Pharmacy Pacific Fair"
  lead="A locally owned community pharmacy on the ground floor of Pacific Fair Shopping Centre, Broadbeach, serving Gold Coast locals and visitors since 2009."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  faqs={faqs}
  showNap
  pageType="AboutPage"
  ogImage={jason}
  dateModified="2026-10-07"
>
  <p>Priceline Pharmacy Pacific Fair is an independently owned Priceline Pharmacy franchise store. Being locally owned means we can shape our services around the people we see every day: Gold Coast locals, families, workers and the many visitors who pass through Pacific Fair.</p>
  <div class="btn-row">
    <a class="btn btn--primary" href={site.phoneHref} data-event="call">Call {site.phone}</a>
    <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/visit-us/">Hours &amp; directions</a>
  </div>

  <h2>What we care about</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Time for you.</strong> We’d rather spend a few extra minutes getting to the bottom of a problem than rush you through. If we can’t help, we’ll refer you, often to the GPs at <a href="/help-medical/">Help Medical</a>, right inside our store.</li>
    <li><strong>Expert advice.</strong> Our pharmacists and beauty advisors are here to answer questions about medicines, wellbeing, skincare and beauty.</li>
    <li><strong>Fair prices.</strong> Competitive pricing without cutting corners on care.</li>
    <li><strong>Better technology, more time with you.</strong> Our robotic dispensary picks medicines in seconds, and electronic shelf labels keep prices accurate. Both free up our team to spend more time with customers. You can also order everyday items for delivery across the Gold Coast through <a href="/delivery/">Uber Eats</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <Image src={dispensary} alt="Jason Markey at the dispensary counter of Priceline Pharmacy Pacific Fair" widths={[480, 760]} sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 760px" />

  <h2>Meet the team</h2>
  <div class="team">
    {pharmacyTeam.map((m) => (
      <div class="member">
        {m.photo && <Image src={jason} alt={`${m.name}, ${m.role}`} width={160} height={160} class="member__photo" />}
        <div>
          <h3>{m.name}</h3>
          <p class="member__role">{m.role}{m.credentials && <> ({m.credentials})</>}</p>
          <p>{m.bio}</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    ))}
  </div>

  <h2>Part of Pacific Fair, part of Broadbeach</h2>
  <p>We’ve been part of Pacific Fair since the store opened in August 2009, and we work alongside the other health services in the centre and across Broadbeach. Whether you live locally or you’re here on holiday, you’ll get the same care: a pharmacist who listens, honest advice, and help finding what you need.</p>
  <p>Come and say hello. We’re open 7 days, until 9pm on Thursdays. <a href="/visit-us/">Opening hours and directions</a>.</p>
</ContentPage>

<style>
  .team { display: grid; gap: var(--s6); margin: var(--s4) 0 var(--s8); }
  .member { display: grid; gap: var(--s4); background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: var(--s5); }
  @media (min-width: 600px) { .member { grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; } }
  .member h3 { margin: 0 0 var(--s1); }
  .member__role { color: var(--pink-deep); font-weight: 600; font-size: var(--fs-sm); margin-bottom: var(--s3); }
  .member p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .member :global(.member__photo) { width: 120px; height: 120px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; object-position: top; }
</style>
